{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>File 47</strong> is not just a game; it\u2019s a window into a shattered mind, an endless echo of a memory that should never have been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479870/extras/Library_hero__5_.gif?t=1742536925\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this disturbing <strong>psychological survival horror</strong>, you will descend into a nightmare that defies logic and reality. A labyrinth of fragmented memories, endless hallways that transform, and shadows that shouldn\u2019t be there. Every decision matters, every corner hides a secret, and every step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479870/extras/Gif_Review_2.gif?t=1742536925\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The past cannot be buried, but can you face it? Unravel the dark mysteries of a trauma marked by violence, explore the deepest recesses of the human mind, and search for answers in a world that refuses to give them up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479870/extras/Library_hero__3_.gif?t=1742536925\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The real question is not what you\u2019ll find at the end, but what you\u2019ll lose along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Are you ready to open the file?</strong></i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3479870/c5f800d47ef6a10fbc974151ad1d6a7259108c2a.jpg"},{"name":"You Escaped, but... At What Cost?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3479870/54d4e369e33f973c0279b2f42c72a38fc19c6bc3.jpg"},{"name":"Liberation or Doom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub